														                                <p><strong>LOVE IT!</strong></p>
														                                <p class="small"><strong><em><a href="https://www.therefinedfeline.com/modern-cat-trees-towers/product/lotus-cat-tower/">Lotus Cat Tower</a></em></strong><br></br>
Love it since it looks like a nice piece of furniture vs. the typical cat towers. Item is Well packaged to protect all pieces, no smell (I&#8217;m very sensitive to chemical smells), fairly easy to put together (took me and my husband about 2 hours to put together), wood finish is flawless, wood feel strong and well made.</p>
