														                                <p><strong>Beautiful!</strong></p>
														                                <p class="small"><strong><em><a href="https://www.therefinedfeline.com/cat-wall-shelves/product/lotus-branch-cat-shelf/">Lotus Branch Cat Shelf</a></em></strong><br></br>
Beautiful shelves. I liked the leaf so much, I ordered the branch (which is very heavy.) Well made, super sturdy, easy to mount (branch requires two people.) Holes to install are spaced to be able to drill into wall studs. Love that the material can be removed to clean!</p>
