														                                <p><strong>So impressed!</strong></p>
														                                <p class="small"><strong><em><a href="https://www.therefinedfeline.com/modern-cat-trees-towers/product/metropolitan-cat-condo/">Metropolitan Cat Condo</a></em></strong><br></br>
I purchased a cat tree in the past (from a different company) that ended up being rickety and ultimately unusable after a short period of use. So when I started shopping again for a new one, I knew I wanted to invest in a quality product that would last. This is it! I am beyond impressed with this product. 
</p>
