														                                <p><strong>Great addition to the cat tower</strong></p>
														                                <p class="small"><em><strong><a href="https://www.therefinedfeline.com/cat-wall-shelves/product/lotus-branch-cat-shelf/">Lotus Branch Cat Shelf</a></strong></em><br></br>
My cats love it. Follow the directions for installation. This shelf is sturdy.

</p>
