														                                <p><strong>The lotus tower that keeps on giving.</strong></p>
														                                <p class="small"><em><strong><a href="https://www.therefinedfeline.com/modern-cat-trees-towers/product/lotus-cat-tower/">Lotus Cat Tower</a></strong></em><br></br>
I received this beautiful lotus tower about 4 months ago and is the center of attention. Well constructed for hours of playing, spring jumping and sleeping. I have 2 Ragdolls 5 &amp; 8 months and a calico 9 yr old. All 3 loved this tower! The best part is on how well it fits/blends beautifully within the home. Recommend this to anyone with cats of any age.
</p>
							                            <div class="trf-judge-me-meta">
