														                                <p><strong>Loved my first, got another soon after!</strong></p>
														                                <p class="small"><strong><em><a href="https://www.therefinedfeline.com/cat-litter-box-furniture-cabinets/product/refined-cat-litter-box-deluxe-furniture/">Refined Litter Box Deluxe</a></em></strong><br></br>
An excellent piece here!! I needed this enclosure, as I live in a small apartment. The furniture is durable, very classy. Sturdy also. My cats feel safe being in it. it looks great with my decor.</p>
