<h2 style="color:#333333; font-size:36px; font-weight:400; line-height:36px; font-family:marcellus;" align="center" id="h-happy-cat-guarantee">Happy Cat Guarantee</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">For cat lovers unsure if their cat will take to our products, we offer a 60-day trial. The trial starts from the day the package is delivered. Some cats need a few weeks to get comfortable with new furniture. Try catnip or treats to help encourage them.</p>



