<div class="gb-container gb-container-137dabec alignfull">
    <div class="trf-sliding-cta">
        <div class="tfr-shape flying-press-lazy-bg">
        </div>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="trf-sliding-cta-text">
				The Refined Feline’s mission is to bring modern, innovative designs to cat furniture. We strive to reinvent how people view the products that they and their feline companions use in their shared space.            </div>
            <div class="trf-sliding-button-wrapper">
                <button type="button" class="trf-text-btn trf-eyebrow trf-btn-arrow trf-text-btn-white trf-sliding-button">
                    Read More                    <svg class="trf-btn-arrow-svg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14"
                         height="12" viewBox="0 0 14 12" fill="none">
                        <path d="M8 11L13 6L8 1" stroke="#333333" stroke-width="1.25"/>
                        <path d="M12 6L0 6" stroke="#333333" stroke-width="1.25"/>
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
	        <div class="trf-sliding-cta-desc">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="trf-sliding-cta-desc-inner">
                    <p>The Refined Feline’s mission is to bring modern, innovative designs to cat furniture. We strive to reinvent how people view the products that they and their feline companions use in their shared space. All of our cat trees, cat wall shelves, cat beds, and litter box furniture are thoughtfully crafted to be the best they can be for you, your home, and your cats. Our team of dedicated cat lovers believes that cat furniture should be embraced and admired as an integral part of your home, just like your cat. In 2004, we got tired of unattractive carpeted cat trees and messy plastic litter trays. We decided to take matters into our own hands and now create a full line of products for cats to enjoy and cat lovers to appreciate.</p>
<p>Our team, based in Austin, Texas, brings our modern cat furniture designs to life so that you and your cats can share your home more cohesively. Designed from sleek metals and solid woods, our litter box cabinets, cat trees. wall shelves, and more are made to last all nine lives. When we develop our products, our first priority is the needs of the cats. Our cat towers incorporate multiple places to perch such as raised platforms to offer bird’s eye views and bottom hide-a-aways for cats who like to dwell closer to the ground. Our cat beds have enclosed spaces to curl up into and our scratching posts are tall enough for any housecat to get a good stretch. You’ll be happy to show off all of these aesthetically pleasing designs in your home.</p>
<p>Our cat furniture is about much more than just looking great in your home though; functionality is just as important. Our multipurpose and customizable cat furniture features replaceable parts so that you can always keep it looking fresh and new. Maintaining the aesthetic, functionality, and cleanliness of cat furniture has never been easier. We knew that cat furniture could be better so we raised the standards. As we say at The Refined Feline: Love Your Cat. Love Your Home.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
	
</div>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>


